"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that writes every record to ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so records survive the app ending, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":" start with the ones ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" kept from earlier runs.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","text":"RecordStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","text":"Consent"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","text":"Sampler"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { Date.now })"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"store","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered."}]}]},{"name":"consent","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"written and delivered; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", every event delivered, by default.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"enrichers","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker."}]}]},{"name":"samplers","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event is kept."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"samplingSeed","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampler’s rate of them.","type":"text"}]}]},{"name":"now","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a stage reading "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given "},{"code":"consent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a record is written once its category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the recovered records from "},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything tracked."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"code":"samplers","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracker","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Tracker","type":"topic"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Enricher","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher","abstract":[{"text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"A tracker that writes every record to ","type":"text"},{"code":"store","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so records survive the app ending, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive"